      "changes": [
        "Replace the upstream date-format fallback with authored proleptic Gregorian parsing and formatting.",
        "Preserve Shopify date input types and format coercion; keep parsed decimal subseconds exact.",
        "Support complete ISO, ordinal, English-month, RFC/asctime and fixed-offset forms; retain the heuristic grammar boundary.",
        "Charge date formatting against output and render-step budgets; bound years and widths.",
        "Match integer size on the qualified 64-bit runtime."
      ],
      "qualification": "122 original date probes checked against the pinned Shopify runtime, plus typed public resource regressions."
    },
