      "changes": [
        "Fail-fast rendering remains the default; explicit diagnostic rendering preserves recovered errors and partial locations.",
        "Reject with an undefined property now raises the reference error instead of silently selecting an empty array.",
        "Preserve output carried through nested break/continue and maintain parser modes and line positions in liquid tags.",
        "Preserve input order and Ruby subscript failure/early-return behavior for undefined reject properties across admitted value types."
      ],
      "qualification": "Original golden case and 36 authored recovery/control-flow/type probes; recovered errors remain separate from successful renders."
